msgid "Two documents back this chapter: {download}`CR Coin tokenomics <../_static/02_decentralchain/downloads/CRCoin-Tokenomics.pdf>` and {download}`CR Coin holder distribution <../_static/02_decentralchain/downloads/CRCoin-Holder-Distribution.pdf>`, the latter listing the hundred largest holders. Figures were read from mainnet at height 2,322,445 on 30 August 2026."
